  Well Steve it seems to me that you are in a lot of trouble. The first
time I did the rogue quest, I had an angry God and died in the pits because
all of my scrolls of teleportation were uncursed and I had no wands or rings
of polymorph or polymorph control. You have to either have a whole bunch of
cursed scrolls of teleportation or a wand or ring of polymorph and ring
of polymorph control to complete the Rogue Quest. 

  If you have a bunch of cursed scrolls of teleportation, you can just
dig a trapdoor above the Master Assasin level and jump down. If you don't
land in the same room as the Master Assasin read your cursed scroll of
teleportation and level teleport out. Repeat the procedure until you 
are in a position to take on the Master Assasin. The coward will run to
the up staircase, meaning you will have to level teleport one last time
and then meet him there.

  If you have a wand or ring of polymorph AND a ring of polymorph control
simply polymorph into a Xorn and seek out and destroy the Master Assasin.

  If your God is angry at you, and you have no means of level teleportation
I fear that you are out of luck.

